== plain
a                         -> a
A                         -> A
space                     -> space
tilde                     -> ~
digits                    -> 0 1 2
== control
CR (enter)                -> enter
LF (ctrl+j in raw mode)   -> ctrl+j
tab                       -> tab
DEL (backspace key)       -> backspace
BS (ctrl+h)               -> backspace
NUL (ctrl+space)          -> ctrl+space
ctrl+a                    -> ctrl+a
ctrl+c                    -> ctrl+c
ctrl+z                    -> ctrl+z
ctrl+backslash            -> ctrl+\
ctrl+underscore           -> ctrl+_
lone escape               -> escape
escape escape             -> escape escape
== alt
alt+a                     -> alt+a
alt+A                     -> alt+A
alt+enter                 -> alt+enter
alt+ctrl+a                -> ctrl+alt+a
== arrows
CSI up                    -> up
CSI down                  -> down
CSI right                 -> right
CSI left                  -> left
SS3 up (application)      -> up
SS3 left (application)    -> left
== navigation
CSI H home                -> home
CSI F end                 -> end
SS3 H home                -> home
SS3 F end                 -> end
CSI 1~ home               -> home
CSI 7~ home (rxvt)        -> home
CSI 2~ insert             -> insert
CSI 3~ delete             -> delete
CSI 4~ end                -> end
CSI 8~ end (rxvt)         -> end
CSI 5~ page up            -> page-up
CSI 6~ page down          -> page-down
CSI Z back-tab            -> back-tab
== function keys
SS3 P f1                  -> f1
SS3 S f4                  -> f4
CSI 11~ f1 (linux)        -> f1
CSI 15~ f5                -> f5
CSI 17~ f6                -> f6
CSI 21~ f10               -> f10
CSI 23~ f11               -> f11
CSI 24~ f12               -> f12
CSI 34~ f20               -> f20
linux console f1          -> f1
linux console f5          -> f5
== modifiers
shift+up                  -> shift+up
alt+up                    -> alt+up
ctrl+up                   -> ctrl+up
ctrl+shift+up             -> ctrl+shift+up
ctrl+alt+up               -> ctrl+alt+up
ctrl+alt+shift+up         -> ctrl+alt+shift+up
meta+up                   -> meta+up
ctrl+page-up              -> ctrl+page-up
shift+delete              -> shift+delete
alt+f1                    -> alt+f1
no first parameter        -> ctrl+up
== csi u
ctrl+a                    -> ctrl+a
ctrl+shift+a              -> ctrl+shift+a
ctrl+enter                -> ctrl+enter
plain e-acute             -> é
a surrogate is refused    -> unknown[1b5b353533303075]
== utf-8
e-acute                   -> é
CJK                       -> 漢
emoji                     -> 😀
alt+e-acute               -> alt+é
a stray 0xff              -> unknown[ff]
a truncated sequence      -> unknown[e6bc]
text around it            -> a é b
== mouse
left down                 -> left-down 12,3
left up                   -> left-up 12,3
right down                -> right-down 1,1
left drag                 -> left-drag 7,8
move, no button           -> moved 7,8
scroll up                 -> scroll-up 5,6
scroll down               -> scroll-down 5,6
ctrl+left down            -> ctrl+left-down 4,4
a big column              -> left-down 300,2
== paste
hi                        -> paste[hi]
with a newline            -> paste[a
b]
empty                     -> paste[]
a key after it            -> paste[x] a
unterminated              -> unknown[1b5b3230307e6162]
== unknown
cursor position report    -> unknown[1b5b31303b323052]
device attributes         -> unknown[1b5b3f363263]
an unknown final byte     -> unknown[1b5b393978]
an unknown tilde number   -> unknown[1b5b39397e]
SS3 with a stray byte     -> unknown[1b4f7a]
a stray paste end         -> unknown[1b5b3230317e]
== runs
three arrows              -> up down right
a key after an arrow      -> up z
escape then an arrow      -> escape up
everything at once        -> a up enter f1 é left-down 1,1
== split across reads
ctrl+up                   -> ctrl+up
SS3 f1                    -> f1
emoji                     -> 😀
mouse                     -> left-down 12,3
paste                     -> paste[hi]
linux console f1          -> f1
lone escape               -> escape
escape escape             -> escape escape
a truncated sequence      -> unknown[e6bc]
everything at once        -> a up enter f1 é left-down 1,1
